{"script":"wt_c3_04_1_y","des":"改良净水仪式","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]嗯！这个数量足够我改良净水仪式了，非常感谢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]要知道……净水仪式看起来简单，但这个仪式的设计以及实施都需要施法者非常谨慎。一不注意时间和材料就都会浪费掉了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]当然等到施法者熟练掌握净水仪式之后，一些成本勉强可以忽略不计，但一次净水仪式能净化的水源实在是太少了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我们夜以继日地努力也净化不了多少，那些无法弥补上的空洞就只能全压圣女身上了。我……不希望圣女承担太大的压力，她是人，不是耗材。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]但是要改变何其困难，我也只能尽自己最大的努力，从改善净水仪式开始了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":290,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}